WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.605
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.875 --> 00:06.875
Lin Zai!

3
00:06.875 --> 00:09.000
How did he end up like this?

4
00:10.159 --> 00:11.416
Lin Zai!

5
00:11.416 --> 00:12.583
I'll go get Dr. He.

6
00:12.583 --> 00:15.458
Don't get him! Hurry, get Cheng!

7
00:30.875 --> 00:34.291
How... How did this happen?

8
00:50.083 --> 00:52.000
He's lost too much blood. It's dangerous.

9
00:52.000 --> 00:53.667
It's best to give him a transfusion now.

10
00:53.667 --> 00:54.941
But...

11
00:54.941 --> 00:57.866
Take my blood. I'm Type O.

12
00:57.866 --> 01:00.074
Okay, I'll go get ready.

13
01:23.916 --> 01:25.458
He's stable for now.

14
01:25.458 --> 01:28.041
But his body is severely weakened.

15
01:29.801 --> 01:31.167
Whether he survives or not...

16
01:31.167 --> 01:33.083
depends on his own will.

17
01:33.083 --> 01:35.625
I'll watch over him.

18
01:35.625 --> 01:37.000
- Okay. - Lie.

19
01:37.000 --> 01:38.292
What exactly happened?

20
01:38.292 --> 01:40.583
Who hurt Lin Zai like this?

21
01:41.417 --> 01:43.057
Lin Zai needs peace and quiet.

22
01:43.057 --> 01:45.084
Everyone, please step out.

23
01:48.292 --> 01:52.292
Lie, take good care of him.

24
02:10.292 --> 02:12.167
Lin Zai.

25
02:12.833 --> 02:14.916
You have to pull through.

26
02:22.833 --> 02:25.750
I'll never leave you again.

27
02:25.750 --> 02:27.208
Please.

28
02:27.208 --> 02:29.666
You have to wake up.

29
02:31.250 --> 02:33.625
You have to wake up.

30
03:34.750 --> 03:39.208
[Apocalypse Log 20]

31
05:24.583 --> 05:26.250
Lin Zai.

32
05:30.000 --> 05:32.125
You damn well dare to show up?

33
05:37.417 --> 05:39.167
Lie, stop it!

34
05:39.167 --> 05:40.375
What are you doing?

35
05:40.375 --> 05:41.751
Stop hitting him!

36
05:41.751 --> 05:45.040
Lie!

37
05:46.458 --> 05:47.999
Lie!

38
05:49.084 --> 05:50.584
Stop...

39
05:51.750 --> 05:53.333
Lin Zai!

40
05:53.968 --> 05:55.884
You're awake.

41
06:00.083 --> 06:02.499
It was all voluntary.

42
06:03.583 --> 06:04.833
Voluntary?

43
06:04.833 --> 06:07.125
He drained you until you're like this!

44
06:08.875 --> 06:12.625
He Yao is researching a way to fight zombies.

45
06:12.625 --> 06:15.056
It's a good thing.

46
06:15.056 --> 06:16.793
It's my own fault for not being careful.

47
06:17.799 --> 06:19.676
It's my fault.

48
06:19.676 --> 06:22.516
I didn't control the amount that was drawn.

49
06:22.516 --> 06:26.141
No research justifies risking a life.

50
06:27.792 --> 06:29.417
Lie.

51
06:34.000 --> 06:35.541
Get out.

52
06:36.167 --> 06:37.792
Then...

53
06:38.667 --> 06:41.000
- Lin Zai, get some rest. - Get out.

54
06:52.542 --> 06:57.504
Child, you can't do anything foolish again.

55
06:59.536 --> 07:01.292
There are so few of us left,

56
07:01.292 --> 07:04.667
we can't afford to lose anyone else.

57
07:05.666 --> 07:09.625
Grandma Qiu, don't worry.

58
07:10.467 --> 07:13.719
He Yao has always been good to me.

59
07:13.719 --> 07:15.928
This was just an accident.

60
07:18.626 --> 07:20.699
When I found you,

61
07:20.699 --> 07:21.709
you were lying there all alone.

62
07:21.709 --> 07:24.192
There wasn't a soul around you.

63
07:24.192 --> 07:26.897
What would've happened if I hadn't returned?

64
07:26.897 --> 07:30.041
He doesn't value your life at all.

65
07:33.364 --> 07:36.612
Grandma Qiu, Chen.

66
07:37.337 --> 07:40.895
I want to talk to Lie alone.

67
07:40.895 --> 07:42.375
You two go and rest.

68
07:42.375 --> 07:43.708
Don't worry.

69
07:43.708 --> 07:45.500
It's okay.

70
08:14.667 --> 08:16.959
You watched over me all night.

71
08:21.250 --> 08:23.477
I thought you left.

72
08:23.477 --> 08:25.685
Why did you come back?

73
08:29.375 --> 08:31.166
Do you really...

74
08:32.133 --> 08:33.841
trust him that much?

75
08:34.899 --> 08:36.583
Enough to let yourself end up like this

76
08:36.583 --> 08:38.833
just to help him with his experiment?

77
08:39.526 --> 08:41.360
You clearly...

78
08:42.175 --> 08:44.583
hated being a test subject.

79
08:44.583 --> 08:45.667
I even let you go.

80
08:45.667 --> 08:48.583
Why go this far for him?

81
08:50.281 --> 08:54.162
If you hadn't woken up, I...

82
09:16.500 --> 09:18.829
That's not it, Lie.

83
09:19.958 --> 09:22.458
I'm not doing this for He Yao.

84
09:22.458 --> 09:24.541
It's for my brother.

85
09:27.232 --> 09:28.941
Your brother?

86
09:30.542 --> 09:32.407
To protect me,

87
09:32.407 --> 09:34.573
my brother was bitten by a zombie.

88
09:35.291 --> 09:36.583
He's in He Yao's lab.

89
09:36.583 --> 09:38.541
I saw him.

90
09:39.875 --> 09:43.333
He Yao said he could turn my brother back into a human.

91
09:43.333 --> 09:44.667
That's why...

92
09:44.667 --> 09:47.690
If you wanted to save him, why not tell me?

93
09:47.690 --> 09:49.565
I thought...

94
09:52.042 --> 09:54.500
you really wanted to push me away.

95
09:55.841 --> 09:57.507
And abandon me.

96
09:58.778 --> 10:00.958
I was just...

97
10:00.958 --> 10:02.743
I was just afraid that if you found out,

98
10:02.743 --> 10:04.785
you would stop me.

99
10:09.667 --> 10:11.375
Lin Zai.

100
10:12.000 --> 10:16.917
So, you didn't really want to kick me out, did you?

101
10:18.466 --> 10:20.792
I'm sorry, Lie.

102
10:20.792 --> 10:24.500
I didn't mean anything I said that day.

103
10:34.251 --> 10:36.584
From now on, no matter what happens,

104
10:37.441 --> 10:39.650
you have to tell me.

105
10:43.385 --> 10:45.510
Don't carry the burden alone anymore.

106
10:46.250 --> 10:48.237
And don't ever...

107
10:48.237 --> 10:50.237
push me away again.

108
10:57.458 --> 10:59.125
Okay.

109
11:16.708 --> 11:18.577
Brother.

110
11:18.577 --> 11:20.577
What happened to your face?

111
11:22.083 --> 11:23.249
It's nothing.

112
11:23.249 --> 11:25.249
I just fell.

113
11:27.583 --> 11:30.999
You used to lie to Mom like that when you were little.

114
11:31.667 --> 11:33.833
Did someone hit you?

115
11:35.625 --> 11:37.083
You slept for a long time this time.

116
11:37.083 --> 11:38.192
How do you feel?

117
11:38.192 --> 11:40.401
Do you feel unwell anywhere?

118
11:45.474 --> 11:47.249
This...

119
11:47.249 --> 11:49.124
The dosage this time...

120
11:52.125 --> 11:53.617
It's not right.

121
11:53.617 --> 11:55.333
Brother.

122
11:55.333 --> 11:57.833
What did you do to that immune subject?

123
12:03.249 --> 12:05.958
This is why you got beaten up, right?

124
12:08.576 --> 12:09.625
Look at me.

125
12:09.625 --> 12:11.666
Answer me!

126
12:22.362 --> 12:24.362
Chang Huan, what are you doing?

127
12:34.500 --> 12:36.250
He Yao.

128
12:36.936 --> 12:39.167
What have you done?

129
12:39.167 --> 12:40.909
You promised me...

130
12:40.909 --> 12:43.530
that you would keep him safe.

131
12:43.530 --> 12:45.708
What do you take him for?

132
12:45.708 --> 12:48.201
A blood bank?

133
12:50.416 --> 12:52.374
Yes.

134
12:52.374 --> 12:55.041
And he has to be one.

135
13:01.458 --> 13:04.333
Without his blood, you'll die.

136
13:04.333 --> 13:05.542
You'll rot.

137
13:05.542 --> 13:08.125
You'll become an irrational monster.

138
13:08.125 --> 13:10.750
Tell me, if I don't treat him as a blood bank,

139
13:10.750 --> 13:11.968
what should I do?

140
13:11.968 --> 13:14.218
What else can I do?

141
13:16.625 --> 13:19.417
Does that give you the right to hurt him like this?

142
13:24.906 --> 13:26.781
He Yao.

143
13:27.504 --> 13:29.796
This is wrong.

144
13:31.680 --> 13:35.250
To me, right and wrong are meaningless now.

145
13:35.250 --> 13:39.250
I just want you to come back.

146
13:45.750 --> 13:48.333
You're not the He Yao I know.

147
13:49.083 --> 13:50.583
The He Yao I know...

148
13:50.583 --> 13:53.333
He would never do such a thing.

149
13:56.624 --> 13:58.083
Stop this.

150
13:58.083 --> 13:59.791
Stop before it's too late.

151
13:59.791 --> 14:01.708
Please?

152
14:31.458 --> 14:33.708
There's no going back.

153
14:36.667 --> 14:38.500
What are you doing?

154
14:43.417 --> 14:44.833
He Yao!

155
14:44.833 --> 14:47.083
He Yao, untie me!

156
14:47.083 --> 14:49.333
You can't keep making these mistakes.

157
14:49.333 --> 14:51.249
He Yao!

158
14:51.917 --> 14:54.556
He Yao!

159
14:54.556 --> 14:56.597
He Yao!

160
15:48.499 --> 15:51.833
It seems I can't let you stay.

161
15:51.833 --> 15:53.874
Lie.

162
16:02.416 --> 16:03.459
You've only just recovered.

163
16:03.459 --> 16:05.611
Don't overwork yourself.

164
16:05.611 --> 16:07.208
I'm fine, Granny Qiu.

165
16:07.208 --> 16:09.000
I feel much better.

166
16:24.083 --> 16:26.035
You made this?

167
16:26.035 --> 16:27.292
He certainly did.

168
16:27.292 --> 16:30.500
This young man is quite capable.

169
16:30.500 --> 16:32.625
He went out before dawn.

170
16:32.625 --> 16:35.125
He actually managed to bring back a pheasant.

171
16:35.125 --> 16:37.208
He also gathered a lot of ingredients.

172
16:37.208 --> 16:40.625
And traded for a bunch of seasonings.

173
17:38.708 --> 17:42.169
Wow, it smells so good.

174
17:43.508 --> 17:45.625
Wow, this smells amazing!

175
17:45.625 --> 17:48.917
Where did you get a pheasant, kid?

176
17:50.625 --> 17:53.205
- Let us have a taste. - Don't touch it.

177
18:20.313 --> 18:22.729
Wow, it smells so good.

178
18:24.708 --> 18:26.202
Move.

179
18:28.917 --> 18:32.542
Go get a bowl. Get a bowl.

180
18:32.542 --> 18:35.083
Go get a bowl. There's enough for everyone.

181
18:35.083 --> 18:37.833
Thank you, Granny Qiu.

182
18:49.840 --> 18:53.218
This time, it's perfect in every way.

183
18:54.610 --> 18:57.667
Who would have thought, in a world like this,

184
18:57.667 --> 19:00.292
we could still have a meal like this?

185
19:03.000 --> 19:04.000
All right.

186
19:04.000 --> 19:05.718
I'll go clean up the pot.

187
19:05.718 --> 19:08.607
I'll leave things here to you, Lie.

188
19:08.607 --> 19:10.625
Granny Qiu, won't you have some?

189
19:10.625 --> 19:13.000
I've already eaten.

190
19:13.000 --> 19:14.708
Okay.

191
19:26.625 --> 19:28.292
What are you looking at?

192
19:28.292 --> 19:30.042
Drink up.

193
19:31.543 --> 19:35.210
I suddenly think you're kind of cute.

194
19:36.625 --> 19:38.792
Nonsense.

195
19:39.911 --> 19:41.568
Just drink it.

196
20:17.333 --> 20:21.292
I didn't expect the camp to have a place like this.

197
20:21.292 --> 20:25.401
In this apocalypse, it's like a hidden paradise.

198
20:25.401 --> 20:28.318
I'll bring you here every day from now on.

199
20:37.750 --> 20:39.583
Lie.

200
20:39.583 --> 20:43.044
Remember I told you about saving my brother?

201
20:44.333 --> 20:47.291
You're still going to cooperate with He Yao's experiment?

202
20:48.618 --> 20:51.831
He's the only family I have left in this world.

203
20:51.831 --> 20:55.125
No matter what, I can't give up on him.

204
20:56.375 --> 20:58.833
Why do you trust He Yao so much?

205
20:58.833 --> 21:01.375
Because I saw it with my own eyes.

206
21:02.375 --> 21:04.425
My brother went from a manic state

207
21:04.425 --> 21:06.650
to slowly calming down.

208
21:06.650 --> 21:10.608
Sometimes, the way he looks at me...

209
21:10.608 --> 21:12.458
It's as if he recognizes me.

210
21:12.458 --> 21:14.583
He just can't speak yet.

211
21:16.167 --> 21:18.250
But your body...

212
21:19.518 --> 21:20.708
I'm much better.

213
21:20.708 --> 21:22.458
I can handle it.

214
21:24.250 --> 21:26.417
I want to go see my brother.

215
21:31.625 --> 21:32.917
Okay.

216
21:32.917 --> 21:34.667
I'll go with you.
